 253:common/prog/ped_fw/timer/system_timer.h ****  *  \details  One timer can have multiple callbacks attached, for example one
 254:common/prog/ped_fw/timer/system_timer.h ****  *            callback for trigger event and one for event error handling. One
 255:common/prog/ped_fw/timer/system_timer.h ****  *            callback instance can be assigned only to one timer instance.
 256:common/prog/ped_fw/timer/system_timer.h ****  *            This function is protected from attaching already attached callback
 257:common/prog/ped_fw/timer/system_timer.h ****  *            instance. Be careful when attaching callback instance, as it has
 258:common/prog/ped_fw/timer/system_timer.h ****  *            to be defined in static memory.
